<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's central bank buys dollars at 1.083.</title>
<headline>Brazil's central bank buys dollars at 1.083.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's central bank on Monday bought dollars at 1.083 reais each in a buy tender in the commercial foreign exchange market, dealers said.</p>
<p>((-- Alexandre Caverni, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5418))</p>
</text>
